    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Engineering Firmware for Innioasis Y2 (Android 4.4 AOSP base - MT6582))",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fy2-ata-rom&amp;tag=y2-ata#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y2 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/releases/download/y2-ata/rom_y2-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/releases/download/y2-ata/rom_y2-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/releases/download/y2-ata/rom_y2-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-ata-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# This is a bare android firmware for modifications to the Innioasis Y2 - it includes flash_tool.exe to install it from Windows systems\r\n# This is not suitable for everyday use - the original firmware is [available here](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom/releases/tag/3.1.7)\r\nDisconnect your Y2 from USB, fully power it off using a paper clip or pin between the headphone jack and charging port\r\n\r\nRun flash_tool.exe\r\n\r\nSelect Format All + Download from the dropdown that reads \"Download\"\r\n\r\nClick Download (green arrow)\r\n\r\nConnect your Y2 and wait for install to finish.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"e57d4ebf56ac14712bc1229cad94e91415843d40cf578c6ad151338d1790ddea\",\"size\":680265217,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"399e1755e5625566eb4b7e2a3577ca87d8d5ef15eb88a4c3bf6a6cad2f140c09\",\"size\":414308198,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"6c128083c5a19f2ce1d0c89a348ba3120f4157bdeb39bdac0c87cde5b79882bb\",\"size\":498776235,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:54:36Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"f01e99f0d5100d7b3ba552b32644c67c9424653ccfea695245f5c9126eb3814f\",\"original_assets\":[\"rom_y2.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"rom_y2-linux.zip\":1,\"rom_y2-macos.zip\":2,\"rom_y2-windows.zip\":1,\"rom_y2.zip\":7},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-08T00:54:36Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119863064,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
